### 定义基础的URL
@host = http://localhost:8080
@basePath = /api/orders

### 创建订单
POST {{host}}{{basePath}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"bookId": 2, "quantity": 3 },
    {"bookId": 4, "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### 根据Id查询订单
GET {{host}}{{basePath}}/5
Authorization: Bearer 123456
Content-Type: application/json
